<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/14th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Battle</p><h1 class="enc-title">Battle of Gammelsdorf</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1313</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Battle of Gammelsdorf was fought on 9 November 1313 near Gammelsdorf in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bavaria">Bavaria</a> between Duke Louis of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/upper-bavaria">Upper Bavaria</a>, later Emperor Louis IV, and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/habsburg-dynasty">Habsburg</a> duke <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/frederick-the-fair">Frederick the Fair</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austria">Austria</a>, who disputed the guardianship of the young dukes of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lower-bavaria">Lower Bavaria</a>. Louis's victory secured the guardianship and raised his standing, helping his election as King of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/roman-empire">Romans</a> the following year.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-gammelsdorf.jpg" alt="Battle of Gammelsdorf" width="320" height="427" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Lou.gruber · CC0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Denkmal_zur_Erinnerung_an_die_Schlacht_von_Gammelsdorf_1313.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
